flowchart LR
  subgraph Public[Public trust boundary]
    Tracker[Public tracking lookup]
  end
  subgraph Customer[Authenticated customer boundary]
    Shipper[Business customer browser]
  end
  subgraph Depot[Authenticated depot boundary]
    Dispatcher[Dispatcher browser]
    Manager[Operations manager browser]
  end
  subgraph CargoLink[CargoLink deployment]
    Web[Next.js responsive web]
    API[NestJS modular-monolith API]
    DB[(PostgreSQL shipment and run data)]
    Queue[(Redis notification queue)]
    Worker[Email worker]
  end
  Email[Transactional email provider]

  Tracker -->|HTTPS + tracking code| Web
  Shipper -->|HTTPS + customer role| Web
  Dispatcher -->|HTTPS + dispatcher role| Web
  Manager -->|HTTPS + manager role| Web
  Web -->|REST JSON + authenticated session| API
  API -->|transactions and run capacity locks| DB
  API -->|committed outbox job| Queue
  Queue --> Worker
  Worker -->|idempotent HTTPS request| Email
  Worker -->|delivery state| DB
